  "description": "This is the story of a Korean family, their family, that we will follow from the beginning of the 70's to the present day; that of a family of modest but protected farmers, who decide to \"go to the capital\", hoping to get the dividends of the Korean dream. The harder and crueller the fall will be.\n\nA mother visits her daughter, who has been living in Paris for years, for the first time. They are Korean. During the few days that the old woman spends with her daughter, memories and family secrets, buried deep in a Korean culture of secrecy, will resurface, and allow the threads of their relationship to finally unravel.",
